 367:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c **** /**
 368:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @brief Computes the rotor average mechanical speed in the unit defined by
 369:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *        #SPEED_UNIT and writes it in pMecSpeedUnit
 370:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *
 371:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *  This method must be called - at least - with the same periodicity
 372:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * on which the speed control is executed. It computes and returns - through
 373:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * parameter pMecSpeedUnit - the rotor average mechanical speed, expressed in
 374:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * the unit defined by #SPEED_UNIT. Average is computed considering a FIFO depth
 375:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * equal to STO_CR_Handle_t::SpeedBufferSizeUnit.
 376:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *
 377:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * Moreover it also computes and returns the reliability state of the sensor,
 378:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * measured with reference to parameters STO_CR_Handle_t::Reliability_hysteresys,
 379:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * STO_CR_Handle_t::VariancePercentage and STO_CR_Handle_t::SpeedBufferSizeUnit of
 380:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * the STO_CR_Handle_t handle.
 381:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *
 382:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @param  pHandle handler of the current instance of the STO CORDIC component
 383:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @param  pMecSpeedUnit pointer to int16_t, used to return the rotor average
 384:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *         mechanical speed
 385:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @retval true if the sensor information is reliable, false otherwise
 386:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   */
 387:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/sto_cordic_speed_pos_fdbk.c **** 
